  "body": "Noncanonical independent supporting mathematics and synthetic executable test. Does not change native producer, owner REC-H5-NATIVE-PATH01, shared DAG 28/88 or any physical null. Existing native-path owner R1-R10 already complete, C1-C4 recorded. Source base 27d20e3d4ef908d4ac5e9b6d8e1d98045a7294d6. Conditional Gronwall/logarithmic-norm radius, positive tube sufficient condition, exact y=f-w error translation, algebraic closure derivatives. 7 local synthetic checks pass in Python 3.13.5; Wolfram scalar first/second derivative residuals {0,0}. Actual native source F, physical defect, positivity, M2, epsilon remain unavailable. NO scientific physical certificate. Do not merge or activate based on this PR. No dual-provider upload is claimed; source files published here, local ZIP produced separately.",
